## § 2 "The Software" — PHOVOS Distributions
The complete, bundled project as officially released and shipped by PHOVOS. This includes the source tree, documentation, build scripts, examples, and/or compiled artifacts (e.g., binaries, container images) as a collective work.

-   License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
-   Notice: `© 2026 PHOVOS:[PHOVOS@outlook.com](mailto:PHOVOS@outlook.com)`
-   This CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license applies only when you received "The Software" package directly from PHOVOS.
-   ShareAlike: If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same license as the original.
-   NonCommercial: You may not use the material for commercial purposes.
-   While embedded individual source files within the package remain BSD-licensed, the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license governs the distribution rights of the collective work you obtained from PHOVOS.

