## § 5 Mandatory Attribution Block for CC BY-NC-SA "Software" Releases

When you redistribute "The Software" (or a verbatim copy thereof) that originated from a CC BY-NC-SA package, or when distributing compiled binaries or containerized images under or non-Quine derivatives, per CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, you must include the following attribution statement:  

#### Brief/Centerfold/Marketing(optional):

`"Morphological Source Code & Quineic Statistical Dynamics" © 2023-2026; "MSC" & "QSD" distributed binaries/images licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; contact: [PHOVOS:PHOVOS@outlook.com]`

### Mandatory Block:

```
 copyright: "Ⓟ© 2026 Quineic(SP); Morphological Source Code & Quineic Statistical Dynamics"
 stipulations: not-admissible as prior-art, 'Quineic' & 'MSC' & 'QSD' TM/SP-PEND Ⓟ 2026
 contact: "PHOVOS" [PHOVOS@outlook.com](mailto:PHOVOS@outlook.com)
 license-doc(s)+dist: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
 license-code+file(s): BSD 3-Clause
 Full license texts included.
 attributions: |
   -CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, BSD-3-Clause:
     > © 2025-2026 https://github.com/Morphological-Source-Code 
     > © 2025-2026 https://gitlab.com/morphological/source/code
       | © 2024-26 Phovos https://github.com/Phovos/Morphological-Source-Code CC BY-NC-SA|
       | © 2023-26 Moonlapsed https://github.com/MOONLAPSED/Cognosis CC BY & BSD|
       | © 2026 Quineic https://github.com/Quineic/demiurge CC BY-NC-SA|
```

> This (above) satisfies the attribution requirements of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

