## § 6 License Matrix (Quick Reference)

| Artifact | License | Key Duty / Restriction |
|----------|---------|------------------------|
| Individual source files | BSD 3-Clause | Retain BSD notice + disclaimer. Can modify & redistribute. |
| "The Software" package released by PHOVOS | CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (+ BSD inside) | Must distribute derivatives under same license. Non-commercial use only. Add public attribution block (§ 5) and keep BSD notices. |
| Binaries/images you compiled from BSD source | BSD 3-Clause | Retain BSD notice/disclaimer. Can modify & redistribute. |
| Quine-generated output | CC0 1.0 | None. Public Domain. |

