This entire document, titled "Morphological LICENSE," or simply the 'LICENSE', including its definitions, stipulations, specific applications, and the verbatim incorporated texts of the BSD 3-Clause License, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License, and Creative Commons Zero 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication, collectively forms a single, compound licensing agreement for the Morphological Source Code, Quineic, and/or Phovos-distributed project. For all intents and purposes, this entire agreement may be referred to simply as the "Morphological LICENSE", or "LICENSE".

