In the event of any conflict or ambiguity between the custom stipulations of §§ 1-6 and the verbatim texts of the BSD 3-Clause License, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, or CC0 1.0, the verbatim texts of the respective standard licenses shall control for the components they govern, except where this "Morphological LICENSE" explicitly provides a more specific application within the context of the Morphological project.


